{"seq":1,"slug":"sed-and-awk","title":"sed 与 awk","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/text-processing-tools/sed-and-awk","wordCount":946,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"sed-与-awk\">sed 与 awk</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>sed 与 awk 是 Unix 文本处理的两大利器，各自代表一种范式：<strong>sed</strong> 是流编辑器，逐行执行&quot;查找—替换—删除&quot;等行级操作；<strong>awk</strong> 是面向文本的编程语言，以<strong>模式-动作</strong>（Pattern-Action）范式自动把每行拆分为字段，适合结构化数据与数值计算。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>sed 的核心是 <code>s</code> 替换命令，配合 BRE/ERE 正则与 <code>-i</code> 原地修改。</li>\n<li>awk 自动按分隔符拆分字段（<code>$1</code>、<code>$2</code>…），支持 BEGIN/END 块、关联数组与算术运算。</li>\n<li>选择依据：替换与行操作用 sed，字段提取、数值计算与报表统计用 awk，二者常通过管道组合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"sed-流编辑器\">sed 流编辑器</h2><p><strong>sed</strong>（Stream Editor）是 Unix/Linux 系统中最重要的文本处理工具之一。它以流的方式逐行处理文本，支持正则表达式驱动的查找、替换、删除和插入操作。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"echo &quot;Hello World&quot; | sed &#39;s/World/Earth/&#39;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;2026-04-01&quot; | sed &#39;s/\\([0-9]\\{4\\}\\)-\\([0-9]\\{2\\}\\)-\\([0-9]\\{2\\}\\)/\\3\\/\\2\\/\\1/&#39;&#10;&#10;cat access.log | sed -n &#39;/ERROR/p&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Hello World\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/World/Earth/'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"2026-04-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/\\([0-9]\\{4\\}\\)-\\([0-9]\\{2\\}\\)-\\([0-9]\\{2\\}\\)/\\3\\/\\2\\/\\1/'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> access.log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/ERROR/p'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>s</code></td>\n<td>替换</td>\n<td><code>s/old/new/</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>d</code></td>\n<td>删除行</td>\n<td><code>/pattern/d</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>p</code></td>\n<td>打印行</td>\n<td><code>-n &#39;/pattern/p&#39;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i</code></td>\n<td>在行前插入</td>\n<td><code>/pattern/i\\text</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>a</code></td>\n<td>在行后追加</td>\n<td><code>/pattern/a\\text</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>c</code></td>\n<td>替换整行</td>\n<td><code>/pattern/c\\text</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>y</code></td>\n<td>字符转换</td>\n<td><code>y/abc/ABC/</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    INPUT[&quot;输入流&quot;] --&gt; READ[&quot;逐行读入&lt;br/&gt;Pattern Space&quot;]&#10;    READ --&gt; CMD[&quot;执行 sed 命令&quot;]&#10;    CMD --&gt; OUTPUT[&quot;输出到 stdout&quot;]&#10;    CMD --&gt;|&quot;-n 静默&quot;| SUPPRESS[&quot;抑制默认输出&quot;]&#10;    OUTPUT --&gt; NEXT[&quot;读取下一行&quot;]&#10;    NEXT --&gt; READ\">graph LR\n    INPUT[\"输入流\"] --&gt; READ[\"逐行读入&lt;br/&gt;Pattern Space\"]\n    READ --&gt; CMD[\"执行 sed 命令\"]\n    CMD --&gt; OUTPUT[\"输出到 stdout\"]\n    CMD --&gt;|\"-n 静默\"| SUPPRESS[\"抑制默认输出\"]\n    OUTPUT --&gt; NEXT[\"读取下一行\"]\n    NEXT --&gt; READ</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"sed-替换进阶\">sed 替换进阶</h2><p>sed 的 <code>s</code> 命令支持丰富的正则语法和替换选项。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"echo &quot;foo bar foo&quot; | sed &#39;s/foo/baz/&#39;&#10;echo &quot;foo bar foo&quot; | sed &#39;s/foo/baz/g&#39;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;Hello World&quot; | sed &#39;s/\\(Hello\\) \\(World\\)/\\2 \\1/&#39;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;camelCase&quot; | sed &#39;s/\\([a-z]\\)\\([A-Z]\\)/\\1_\\l\\2/g&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"foo bar foo\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/foo/baz/'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"foo bar foo\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/foo/baz/g'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Hello World\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/\\(Hello\\) \\(World\\)/\\2 \\1/'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"camelCase\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/\\([a-z]\\)\\([A-Z]\\)/\\1_\\l\\2/g'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>替换标志详解：</p>\n<h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标志</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>g</code></td>\n<td>替换所有匹配</td>\n<td><code>s/a/b/g</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>i</code></td>\n<td>忽略大小写（GNU sed）</td>\n<td><code>s/hello/Hi/i</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>p</code></td>\n<td>打印替换后的行</td>\n<td><code>s/old/new/p</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>w</code></td>\n<td>将替换结果写入文件</td>\n<td><code>s/old/new/w file.txt</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>n</code></td>\n<td>仅替换第 n 次匹配</td>\n<td><code>s/a/b/2</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"echo &quot;line with    extra   spaces&quot; | sed &#39;s/  */ /g&#39;&#10;&#10;sed -i &#39;&#39; &#39;s/TODO/DONE/g&#39; *.md&#10;&#10;sed -n &#39;10,20p&#39; file.txt&#10;&#10;sed &#39;/^$/d&#39; file.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"line with    extra   spaces\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/  */ /g'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/TODO/DONE/g'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '10,20p'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/^$/d'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> file.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> macOS 的 sed 是 BSD 版本，与 GNU sed 有语法差异。<code>-i</code> 选项在 macOS 上需要指定备份后缀（空字符串 <code>&#39;&#39;</code> 表示不备份），而 GNU sed 可以直接 <code>-i</code>。建议安装 GNU sed（<code>brew install gnu-sed</code>）以获得一致的体验。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"awk-编程语言\">awk 编程语言</h2><p><strong>awk</strong> 是一种面向文本处理的编程语言，以<strong>模式-动作</strong>（Pattern-Action）为基本范式。它将每行输入自动按分隔符拆分为字段，天然适合处理结构化文本数据。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"echo &quot;Alice 90 85 92&quot; | awk &#39;{print $1, ($2+$3+$4)/3}&#39;&#10;&#10;awk -F&#39;,&#39; &#39;{print $1, $3}&#39; data.csv&#10;&#10;awk &#39;/ERROR/ {count++} END {print count}&#39; server.log\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Alice 90 85 92\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $1, ($2+$3+$4)/3}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">','</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $1, $3}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> data.csv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/ERROR/ {count++} END {print count}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> server.log</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内置变量</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>$0</code></td>\n<td>当前行完整内容</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>$1-$n</code></td>\n<td>第 n 个字段</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NR</code></td>\n<td>当前行号</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>NF</code></td>\n<td>当前行的字段数</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>FS</code></td>\n<td>字段分隔符</td>\n<td>空白</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>OFS</code></td>\n<td>输出字段分隔符</td>\n<td>空格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RS</code></td>\n<td>记录分隔符</td>\n<td>换行</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    AWK[&quot;awk 执行流程&quot;] --&gt; BEGIN[&quot;BEGIN 块&lt;br/&gt;初始化&quot;]&#10;    BEGIN --&gt; LOOP[&quot;逐行处理&quot;]&#10;    LOOP --&gt; PATTERN[&quot;模式匹配&quot;]&#10;    PATTERN --&gt;|匹配| ACTION[&quot;执行动作&quot;]&#10;    PATTERN --&gt;|不匹配| SKIP[&quot;跳过&quot;]&#10;    ACTION --&gt; NEXT[&quot;下一行&quot;]&#10;    SKIP --&gt; NEXT&#10;    NEXT --&gt; LOOP&#10;    LOOP --&gt;|&quot;文件结束&quot;| ENDBLOCK[&quot;END 块&lt;br/&gt;收尾&quot;]\">graph TD\n    AWK[\"awk 执行流程\"] --&gt; BEGIN[\"BEGIN 块&lt;br/&gt;初始化\"]\n    BEGIN --&gt; LOOP[\"逐行处理\"]\n    LOOP --&gt; PATTERN[\"模式匹配\"]\n    PATTERN --&gt;|匹配| ACTION[\"执行动作\"]\n    PATTERN --&gt;|不匹配| SKIP[\"跳过\"]\n    ACTION --&gt; NEXT[\"下一行\"]\n    SKIP --&gt; NEXT\n    NEXT --&gt; LOOP\n    LOOP --&gt;|\"文件结束\"| ENDBLOCK[\"END 块&lt;br/&gt;收尾\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"awk-中的正则表达式\">awk 中的正则表达式</h2><p>awk 原生支持正则表达式作为模式匹配条件，并提供了 <code>match</code>、<code>sub</code>、<code>gsub</code> 等正则函数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"awk &#39;/^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}/&#39; log.txt&#10;&#10;echo &quot;Hello World&quot; | awk &#39;{gsub(/[aeiou]/, &quot;*&quot;); print}&#39;&#10;&#10;echo &quot;2026-04-01 ERROR timeout&quot; | awk &#39;match($0, /[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}/) {print substr($0, RSTART, RLENGTH)}&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}/'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log.txt</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Hello World\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{gsub(/[aeiou]/, \"*\"); print}'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"2026-04-01 ERROR timeout\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'match($0, /[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}/) {print substr($0, RSTART, RLENGTH)}'</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>语法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>match</code></td>\n<td>正则搜索</td>\n<td><code>match(str, /regex/)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sub</code></td>\n<td>替换首个匹配</td>\n<td><code>sub(/regex/, &quot;new&quot;, str)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gsub</code></td>\n<td>替换所有匹配</td>\n<td><code>gsub(/regex/, &quot;new&quot;, str)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>split</code></td>\n<td>按正则拆分</td>\n<td><code>split(str, arr, /regex/)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>gensub</code></td>\n<td>带反向引用的替换(gawk)</td>\n<td><code>gensub(/re/, &quot;\\\\1&quot;, &quot;g&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"awk -F&#39;[,;]&#39; &#39;{for(i=1;i&lt;=NF;i++) print $i}&#39; mixed.csv&#10;&#10;awk &#39;{&#10;  for(i=1; i&lt;=NF; i++)&#10;    if($i ~ /^[0-9]+$/) sum += $i&#10;}&#10;END {print &quot;Sum:&quot;, sum}&#39; data.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'[,;]'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{for(i=1;i&#x3C;=NF;i++) print $i}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mixed.csv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">awk</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  for(i=1; i&#x3C;=NF; i++)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    if($i ~ /^[0-9]+$/) sum += $i</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">END {print \"Sum:\", sum}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> data.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><ul>\n<li><strong>提示：</strong> awk 使用 ERE（扩展正则表达式）语法，不需要像 BRE（基本正则表达式）那样转义圆括号和花括号。<code>gawk</code>（GNU awk）还支持 <code>\\b</code>、<code>\\w</code> 等 Perl 风格的转义序列。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"sed-与-awk-的选择\">sed 与 awk 的选择</h2><p>两个工具各有优势，了解它们的适用场景能帮助你做出正确选择。</p>\n<h3 id=\"速查表\">速查表</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐工具</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单查找替换</td>\n<td>sed</td>\n<td>单行命令即可完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>行删除/插入</td>\n<td>sed</td>\n<td>流编辑器的本职工作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段提取</td>\n<td>awk</td>\n<td>内置字段拆分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数值计算</td>\n<td>awk</td>\n<td>支持算术运算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多条件处理</td>\n<td>awk</td>\n<td>完整编程语言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原地文件修改</td>\n<td>sed</td>\n<td><code>-i</code> 选项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报表统计</td>\n<td>awk</td>\n<td>BEGIN/END 块和关联数组</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"代码示例\">代码示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"sed &#39;s/error/ERROR/gi&#39; log.txt | awk -F: &#39;{print $1}&#39; | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sed</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 's/error/ERROR/gi'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> log.txt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> awk</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -F:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{print $1}'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uniq</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sort</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -rn</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"图示\">图示</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    TASK[&quot;文本处理任务&quot;] --&gt; SIMPLE[&quot;简单替换/删除&quot;]&#10;    TASK --&gt; FIELDS[&quot;字段处理&quot;]&#10;    TASK --&gt; COMPLEX[&quot;复杂逻辑&quot;]&#10;    SIMPLE --&gt; SED[&quot;sed&quot;]&#10;    FIELDS --&gt; AWK[&quot;awk&quot;]&#10;    COMPLEX --&gt; AWK&#10;    SED --&gt; PIPE[&quot;管道组合&quot;]&#10;    AWK --&gt; PIPE\">graph LR\n    TASK[\"文本处理任务\"] --&gt; SIMPLE[\"简单替换/删除\"]\n    TASK --&gt; FIELDS[\"字段处理\"]\n    TASK --&gt; COMPLEX[\"复杂逻辑\"]\n    SIMPLE --&gt; SED[\"sed\"]\n    FIELDS --&gt; AWK[\"awk\"]\n    COMPLEX --&gt; AWK\n    SED --&gt; PIPE[\"管道组合\"]\n    AWK --&gt; PIPE</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((sed 与 awk))&#10;    sed&#10;      流编辑器&#10;      &quot;s 替换命令&quot;&#10;      &quot;d p 行操作&quot;&#10;      &quot;-i 原地修改&quot;&#10;      BRE/ERE 正则&#10;    awk&#10;      编程语言&#10;      模式-动作范式&#10;      字段自动拆分&#10;      数值运算&#10;      match/gsub 函数&#10;    选择指南&#10;      替换用 sed&#10;      字段处理用 awk&#10;      统计报表用 awk&#10;      管道组合两者\">mindmap\n  root((sed 与 awk))\n    sed\n      流编辑器\n      \"s 替换命令\"\n      \"d p 行操作\"\n      \"-i 原地修改\"\n      BRE/ERE 正则\n    awk\n      编程语言\n      模式-动作范式\n      字段自动拆分\n      数值运算\n      match/gsub 函数\n    选择指南\n      替换用 sed\n      字段处理用 awk\n      统计报表用 awk\n      管道组合两者</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>sed</strong> 是流编辑器，擅长逐行的查找替换和行操作，<code>s</code> 命令是最常用的功能。</li>\n<li><strong>awk</strong> 是面向文本处理的编程语言，以模式-动作范式自动拆分字段，适合结构化数据处理。</li>\n<li>sed 使用 BRE（基本正则），<code>-E</code> 选项切换为 ERE（扩展正则）；awk 默认使用 ERE。</li>\n<li>sed 适合简单替换和行操作，awk 适合字段提取、数值计算和复杂逻辑。</li>\n<li>实际工作中常通过管道将 sed、awk 与其他工具组合使用，发挥各自优势。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"sed 与 awk","id":"sed-与-awk"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"sed 流编辑器","id":"sed-流编辑器"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":2,"text":"sed 替换进阶","id":"sed-替换进阶"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"awk 编程语言","id":"awk-编程语言"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":2,"text":"awk 中的正则表达式","id":"awk-中的正则表达式"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":2,"text":"sed 与 awk 的选择","id":"sed-与-awk-的选择"},{"level":3,"text":"速查表","id":"速查表"},{"level":3,"text":"代码示例","id":"代码示例"},{"level":3,"text":"图示","id":"图示"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"引擎差异","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/regex-engines/engine-differences"},"next":{"title":"grep 与 ripgrep","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/regex-text-processing/text-processing-tools/grep-and-ripgrep"}}